{"ts": 0.223892, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv — task\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nProve that a child program can see a variable you exported. You will\r\n", "len": 97}
{"ts": 0.223928, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "work inside \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-onsj3thd/env\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n  1. set \u001b[92mTOPIC\u001b[0m to the word \u001b[36mshell\u001b[0m\r\n  2. export it\r\n  3. run a child \u001b[92mbash -c\u001b[0m that prints \u001b[92m$TOPIC\u001b[0m into \u001b[94mseen.txt\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[90m(hint: single quotes, so the child replaces the variable)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mI will check: seen.txt holds the word shell, and your history shows\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mTOPIC set, exported, and read inside single quotes by a child.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 537}
{"ts": 0.226778, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.227059, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.240219, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.240312, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\n", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.240335, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 22}
{"ts": 0.240431, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004h", "len": 8}
{"ts": 0.240442, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "shelltutor> ", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.240463, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export TOPIC\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.240485, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export TOPIC\r\n", "len": 14}
{"ts": 0.240495, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 9}
{"ts": 0.240559, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004h", "len": 8}
{"ts": 0.240569, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "shelltutor> ", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.24059, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "bash -c 'echo $TOPIC' > seen.txt\n", "len": 33}
{"ts": 0.240639, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "bash -c 'echo $TOPIC' > seen.txt\r\n", "len": 34}
{"ts": 0.240649, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 9}
{"ts": 0.24682, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.246886, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "check\n", "len": 6}
{"ts": 0.246914, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "check\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.271068, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.27229, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule · env\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 243}
{"ts": 0.272322, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.272405, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv cleared.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nCommands and keys from this module:\r\n", "len": 64}
{"ts": 0.272444, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92mname=value    \u001b[0m \u001b[90mset a variable in this shell\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mexport name   \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlet child programs see it\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mecho \"$PATH\"  \u001b[0m \u001b[90mthe folders searched for programs\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92menv           \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlist what children receive\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mPS1='$ '      \u001b[0m \u001b[90mchange the prompt (this shell only)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mquit\u001b[93m to leave, or \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to return to the start of this module.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 437}
{"ts": 0.275011, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(start this module again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(leave)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(this screen again)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 134}
{"ts": 0.275286, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.2753, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.288117, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.288182, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "quit\n", "len": 5}
{"ts": 0.288201, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "quit\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.290574, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.290715, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "Bye. A module saves nothing; run 'shelltutor env' to start it again.\r\n", "len": 70}
